FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: actuarial-projections.

OFF THE RECORD: the first sixteen Fibonacci numbers, computed by
OFF THE RECORD: recursive petition, each call a fresh round trip
OFF THE RECORD: through the broker. The Court is in no hurry.

ARTICLE 1.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT i IS 0.

ARTICLE 2.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF actuarial-services REGARDING i.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT i IS i PLUS 1.
    SHOULD i FAIL TO EXCEED 15, REFER TO ARTICLE 2.

ARTICLE 3.
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.

THE OFFICE OF actuarial-services, CONCERNING n.
    SHOULD n FAIL TO EXCEED 1, REMAND WITH n.
    REMAND WITH (THE FINDING OF actuarial-services REGARDING n LESS 1)
        PLUS (THE FINDING OF actuarial-services REGARDING n LESS 2).
